	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 18th level, your devotion to your companion is the strongest it’s ever been and vice versa. Once per long rest, you can expend up to four hit dice as an action and provide them as healing to your companion. If your companion has failed three death saving throws, you may instead expend six hit dice, or take an amount of damage equal to rolling six hit dice, to restore your companion to life. Your companion can also use this ability, targeting you.</p>",
